  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">搭配原版 New Default+ 資源包使用此擴充包可獲得最佳體驗。連結：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_dc3f9494a38a4984aa8397c824fd121b~mv2.png\" alt=\"ND+_divider\" width=\"1519\" height=\"304\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">這是我的資源包 New Default+ 的 PvP 擴充/附加包</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">New Default+ 下載按鈕：</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_ab455951e8b24116b88fb44e341beeac~mv2.png\" alt=\"ND+_divider\" width=\"1519\" height=\"304\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\"> 本擴充包與 New Default+ 一樣持續更新中，請務必追蹤此專案以便在發布更新時接收通知！</span><br><strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpluspvpaddon/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#339\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\">[Java 版：<span style=\"color:#f60\">1.17-1.20.4</span>]</span>&nbsp;</span></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong><a style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpluspvpaddon/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:8203\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong>[Java 版：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\">1.15-1.16.5</span>]</strong></strong></a><strong style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong><a style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpluspvpaddon/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong>[Java 版：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3cc\">1.9-1.12.2</span></strong></strong></a><strong style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpvpplus/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:628\" rel=\"nofollow\">]</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpluspvpaddon/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:4\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Java 版：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9c0\">1.6.1-1.8.9</span>]</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong><a style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultpluspvpaddon/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:17\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong>[<span style=\"color:#936\">基岩版</span>]</strong></strong></a></p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>「全亮」模式（無黑暗）：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/385/866/fullbright.png\" alt=\"Fullbright Screenshot\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">發光描邊礦石：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:10px\">[注意：必須停用全亮模式才能在黑暗中看到礦石發光效果，請在 OptiFine 設定中關閉「自訂色彩」功能來停用全亮模式。]</span></p><p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/385/867/emissive-outlined-ores.png\" alt=\"Emissive &amp; Outlined Ores Screenshot\" width=\"1519\" height=\"854\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"><span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">縮短版工具：</span></p><p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/385/868/shorter-tools.png\" alt=\"Shorter Tools Screenshot\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></em></p><p><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:36px\">弓與弩充能指示器：</span></p><p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/385/869/bow-crossbow-charging-indicator.png\" alt=\"Bow &amp; Crossbow Charging Indicator Screenshot\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></em></p><p><em><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></em></p><div>\n<ul class=\"covert-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/matti0113\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>檢視使用者檔案</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=matti0113\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>傳送訊息</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/my-notifications/3-29627910/11/toggle-subscription\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>追蹤使用者</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/100057950/ignore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>忽略使用者</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><strong>下載此資源包即代表您同意以下條款：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>您可以隨意使用並修改此資源包～</li>\n<li>不得以自身名義重新發布此資源包的下載檔～</li>\n<li>未經本人直接許可，不得以任何形式重新發布此資源包的個別元素～</li>\n<li>不得聲稱擁有此資源包中任何元素的所有權～</li>\n</ul><p><strong><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/73bea7_1ad608ce5e3a4596b5df99dc535f2903~mv2.png\" alt=\"divider_small\" width=\"1519\" height=\"78\"></strong></p><p><strong>請盡情享受此資源包！請在留言區回報錯誤與提出建議～ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpowerups4u.wixsite.com%252fseaofpixels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>SeaOfPixels</em></a></strong></p><p><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/385/874/divider_pvp_addon_new.png\" alt=\"divider\" width=\"1519\" height=\"304\"></em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
